       ["Channels", "Mono or stereo in, stereo out · latency 0 samples · sample rates 44.1 to 192 kHz"],
       ["Phase stages", "4 all-pass stages, 47 nF, 24 kΩ // JFET 2N5952 (Ron ≈ 400 Ω, Vp ≈ −2.4 V, four slightly mismatched JFETs)"],
